    <h2>Ethical UX</h2>
    <p>Here are some ways to avoid dark patterns in your design and make sure they they remain ethical:</p>

    <figure>
        <img src="img/ethical-ux.png" class="ethical-ux" alt="Ethical UX">
    </figure>
    <ul>
        <li>Simplify the user experience.</li>
        <li>Provide as much transparency as possible.</li>
        <li>Design with accessibility in mind.</li>
        <li>Allow users to easily change or withdraw their consent.</li>
        <li>Respect user privacy and ensure data is protected.</li>
    </ul>
